    ethernet.ipv6.sctp.f1ap.F1AP-PDU.initiatingMessage.value.ULRRCMessageTransfer.protocolIEs.Item 3.ProtocolIE-Field.value.RRCContainer.0   ).NR Radio Resource Control (RRC) protocol.UL-DCCH-Message.message.c1.rrcSetupComplete.criticalExtensions.rrcSetupComplete.dedicatedNAS-Message.Non-Access-Stratum 5GS (NAS)PDU.Plain NAS 5GS Message.Service type.Service type = 4

